    "summary": "Perennial plant of unspecified native origin. It grows along roadside verges and hedgerows and is probably introduced in England and Wales; it is also found in the southern Alps, Pyrenees and Caucasus.",
    "humanEdibility": "unknown",
    "edibilityNote": null,
    "evidence": {
